        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Other cost of revenues primarily includes:",
        "text_hash": "c893969886ec769f70bb3f8543cb7da51c9d26e933a8e4fa6940d398973d7d8e",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000460-4f5ad61b",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[492]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 460,
        "reported_page": 31,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_85",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "72pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "◦content acquisition costs, which are payments to content providers from whom we license video and other content for distribution, primarily related to YouTube (we pay fees to these content providers based on revenues generated, subscriber counts, or a flat fee);",
        "text_hash": "4f5ad61b206e96958dc6578afbb1a9f829e608270916f34a6e32c205da25facc",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
